{
 "about": "Drawn-balloon placements of the approved chapter 4 picks, from the planner with the cover crop: each visible_rect is the frame's crop for the pick's slot (reserves.cover_crop). Only panels the compositor fit check passed are kept: a later change to the planner must leave them identical. Regenerated for the cover crop; the earlier golden, from the planner before it (19, 21 and 26 placements under prior, ratio and probe), is kept in review/ as golden_ch04_drawn_planner.json.backup-pre-cover-crop. Layouts: prior = chapters/ch04/LAYOUT.json, ratio and probe = fit-layout outputs, with r4 tails and faces at 0.55. Regenerated again for the tail and reading rules (place_boxes: a tail never crosses another balloon or a face that is not its speaker's, balloons sit near their speakers, boxes read in script order): of the 76 placements above (24, 26, 26 under prior, ratio and probe) 44 are unchanged, 27 moved and 5 are now refused (page-01-panel-04-v01 under all three layouts: a tail through the next balloon; page-06-panel-01-v06 under ratio and probe: no room for chunk 1 to read after chunk 0), leaving 23, 24, 24. The one from before the tail rules is kept in review/ as golden_ch04_drawn_planner.json.backup-pre-tail-cross. Updated for the flat black letterbox trim (reserves.PAD_BLACK): page-02-panel-03-v02 has a 2 to 3 px black border that art_bounds now trims, so its visible_rect starts at [4, 3] and its boxes shift with it. Updated for off-frame proximity (reserves.place_boxes ranks a voice off frame by nearness to its edge point): page-03-panel-05-v04 chunk 0, the Wary Fisherman off the left edge, now sits at the top left beside its edge point instead of mid-top with a tail across the frame; its other chunks are unchanged. Updated for the stricter reading order (reserves._reads_after: off a shared line a later box must start lower, not merely not lie entirely above): the placements listed as changed now read in script order where the old ones had a later balloon starting higher. Updated for the tail-tip rule (reserves.place_boxes: a balloon's drawn tail tip is never nearer another face than its speaker's) and the tail room of an off-frame voice (its box keeps TAIL_MIN_PT plus the stroke from that edge): of the 71 placements above, 63 are unchanged, 5 moved and 3 are now refused, leaving 22, 23, 23 under prior, ratio and probe. page-03-panel-05-v04 under prior: chunk 0, the Wary Fisherman off the left edge, moves 48 px right, because it touched the edge before and its tail now has room; its other chunks are unchanged. page-03-panel-05-v04 under ratio and probe: the tip rule leaves chunk 2 no place beside chunk 1 in the near-speaker pass, so the quiet pass places all three chunks anew, chunk 0 at the top right and chunk 1 at the left. page-04-panel-04-v04 under prior: chunks 0 and 2 move (chunk 0 from x 976 to 768, chunk 2 from x 68 to 221), so that the tips of their tails land at their own speakers. page-04-panel-04-v04 under probe: chunks 0 and 2 move likewise (chunk 0 from x 784 to 756, chunk 2 from x 135 to 1050). page-04-panel-05-v05 is refused under all three layouts (chunk 0: its tail tip would point at another face, face 1): its balloon can only sit where the tip of its tail lands nearer that man's face than its speaker's. Updated for the per-chunk proximity fallback (reserves.place_boxes gives up nearness only for the chunks that need it): page-03-panel-05-v04 and page-04-panel-02-v03 under ratio and probe keep their near-speaker balloons where the all-or-nothing fallback had moved every balloon by quietness. Updated for reading order by tops (reserves._reads_after, READ_ROW_SHARE): page-03-panel-04-v05 and page-04-panel-04-v04 had a later balloon whose top sat well above an earlier one beside it; they now read in script order. Reading order (2026-10-01): a later box that starts lower but within the upper 60 percent of an earlier one sits beside it and must be to its right, and tops count as level within 0.4 (was 0.5) of the shorter height. The old placements of page-05-panel-05-v05 (Nagoji's answer 84 px above the question, to its right) and page-03-panel-04-v05 under ratio and probe (the third balloon beside the second, to its left) were the misorders the r4 review confirmed; the new ones pass the fit check and read in script order, and page-05-panel-05-v05 under ratio and probe is now refused rather than lettered out of order. The golden before this change is in review/golden_ch04_drawn_planner.json.backup-pre-level-order. Reading order (2026-10-01, later): a later box is beside an earlier one when it starts lower by less than two thirds of the SHORTER box's height (was 0.6 of the earlier box's); under it the ratio and probe placements of page-03-panel-04-v05 may put their third balloon 30 px higher (both the old and the new placement read in script order and pass the fit check). The golden before this change is in review/golden_ch04_drawn_planner.json.backup-pre-level-shorter. Reading order, final (2026-10-01): a strict rule is tried first (tops level within a quarter of the shorter box; a later box at the LEFT must start below the earlier one), and the lenient rule only when no placement meets it. page-03-panel-03-v05 (all layouts) and page-05-panel-05-v05 (prior) now have strictly ordered placements; the golden before is in review/golden_ch04_drawn_planner.json.backup-pre-left-below. Off-panel tails (2026-10-01): a tail to a speaker off the panel now runs to the border, and the planner checks that full length, so page-03-panel-05-v04 (ratio and probe) is re-placed; the golden before is in review/golden_ch04_drawn_planner.json.backup-pre-offpanel-tail. Lenient band (2026-10-01): in the fallback order rule, a later box starting lower with at least half of the shorter box's height inside the earlier box's band is level (it must be to the right), so page-03-panel-04-v05 (ratio and probe) moves its third balloon from beside the second to below most of it; the golden before is in review/golden_ch04_drawn_planner.json.backup-pre-lenient-band.",
